  title="Kova Case Study"
  description="Kova: Xkye's own project, issue and knowledge tool. A case study by Xkye Solutions with a live interactive prototype."
  site="https://kova.xkye.app/"
  ogTitle="Kova Case Study · Xkye Solutions"
  ogDescription="Issues, plans and documents in one tool that uses the same words everywhere. With a live interactive prototype."
>
